{
  "name": "AI Lead Catcher",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI Lead Catcher\n\nWebsite form, then the AI scores the lead (Hot, Warm or Cold) and writes a personal reply. The reply is sent by Gmail and the lead is saved to Google Sheets.\n\nSetup:\n1. Edit Business Settings.\n2. Connect your chat model, Gmail and Google Sheets.\n3. Create a sheet with the columns listed in the README.\n\nNeed it set up for your business? evoxaitech.com",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 440
      },
      "name": "Setup Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "Get a free consultation",
        "formDescription": "Tell us what you need and we will reply within minutes.",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Name",
              "placeholder": "Your full name",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Email",
              "fieldType": "email",
              "placeholder": "you@example.com",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Company",
              "placeholder": "Company name"
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "What do you need help with?",
              "fieldType": "textarea",
              "placeholder": "e.g. We miss WhatsApp messages after 10 PM",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Budget",
              "fieldType": "dropdown",
              "fieldOptions": {
                "values": [
                  {
                    "option": "Under $300"
                  },
                  {
                    "option": "$300 - $1,000"
                  },
                  {
                    "option": "$1,000 - $3,000"
                  },
                  {
                    "option": "$3,000+"
                  },
                  {
                    "option": "Not sure yet"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "requiredField": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false,
          "respondWithOptions": {
            "values": {
              "formSubmittedText": "Thanks! Check your inbox, our reply is on its way."
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "name": "Lead Form",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "business_name",
              "name": "business_name",
              "value": "Your Business",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "sender_name",
              "name": "sender_name",
              "value": "Your Name",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "contact_email",
              "name": "contact_email",
              "value": "you@example.com",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "services",
              "name": "services",
              "value": "AI Chatbot, Workflow Automation, Custom Software",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "hot_budget",
              "name": "hot_budget",
              "value": "$1,000",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "timezone",
              "name": "timezone",
              "value": "Asia/Dubai",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Business Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=New lead from the website form:\nName: {{ $json[\"Name\"] }}\nEmail: {{ $json[\"Email\"] }}\nCompany: {{ $json[\"Company\"] }}\nWhat they need: {{ $json[\"What do you need help with?\"] }}\nBudget: {{ $json[\"Budget\"] }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "=You qualify inbound leads for {{ $('Business Settings').item.json.business_name }}. What we offer: {{ $('Business Settings').item.json.services }}.\n\nRead the lead and return ONLY the JSON object described by the format instructions.\n\nScoring:\n- Hot: clear need that matches our services AND a budget of {{ $('Business Settings').item.json.hot_budget }} or more, or an urgent timeline.\n- Warm: real need that matches our services, but a small or unclear budget or no timeline.\n- Cold: unrelated to our services, spam, or no real need.\n\nservice: the one best match from this list, or \"Not a fit\": {{ $('Business Settings').item.json.services }}.\n\nreply_subject and reply_body: a short, warm, personal email reply to the lead, written as {{ $('Business Settings').item.json.sender_name }} from {{ $('Business Settings').item.json.business_name }}.\n- Use the lead's first name and refer to their specific need in one sentence.\n- Offer a free 15-minute call. Do not quote prices, timelines or results, and do not promise anything.\n- If the lead wrote in Arabic, write the whole reply in Arabic. Otherwise write in English.\n- Plain text, 4 to 7 short lines, signed: {{ $('Business Settings').item.json.sender_name }}, {{ $('Business Settings').item.json.business_name }}, {{ $('Business Settings').item.json.contact_email }}\n- For Cold leads, reply politely and briefly, without pushing a call."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "AI Lead Scorer",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [
        460,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "gpt-4o-mini"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        400,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsonSchemaExample": "{\n  \"score\": \"Hot\",\n  \"score_reason\": \"Clear WhatsApp need, $1,000-$3,000 budget\",\n  \"service\": \"AI Chatbot\",\n  \"summary\": \"Dental clinic misses WhatsApp bookings after hours\",\n  \"reply_subject\": \"Your WhatsApp bookings, answered day and night\",\n  \"reply_body\": \"Hi Sara,\\n...\"\n}"
      },
      "name": "Lead JSON",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        580,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $('Lead Form').item.json[\"Email\"] }}",
        "subject": "={{ $('AI Lead Scorer').item.json.output.reply_subject }}",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "={{ $('AI Lead Scorer').item.json.output.reply_body }}",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "name": "Reply to Lead",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        780,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
